le now, right on this page. ❤️ Add Everybody Loves a Good Hole to your wishlist so you don't miss the launch. 📅 Coming November 3!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:32:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691823","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4978010-1844751498221813","game_id":"steam-4978010","kind":"announcement","title":"The Demo Is Out Now!","summary":"The demo is here! 🕳️We've been working hard on Everybody Loves a Good Hole, and today you can finally get your hands on it. The free demo is now available on Steam! What's in the demo?Feature 1 – e.g. core gameplay loopFeature 2 – e.g. number of levels/runsFeature 3 – e.g. upgrades availableWe want your feedback! This is an early look at the game, and your feedback directly shapes the full version. Share your thoughts in the Steam Discussions or join us on Discord. Wishlist now The full game lau","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T15:01:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498221813","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4978010-1843481262700146","game_id":"steam-4978010","kind":"announcement","title":"📢 Big News, Hole Lovers! 🕳️","summary":"We're moving up the release date for Everybody Loves a Good Hole!We didn't want to keep you waiting any longer to fall into this black hole. Our team put in extra hours and pushed harder, and we're proud to announce:The game is now launching on Steam November 3, 2026 — instead of November 16! 🕳️13 days earlier. Same passion, same care, just a shorter wait.Swallow small cubes, grow bigger, then swallow the whole screen. Pour your XP and coins into a deep upgrade tree, and unleash magic book power","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-13T20:15:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262700146","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4978010-1842846814455101","game_id":"steam-4978010","kind":"announcement","title":"Everybody Loves a Good Hole launches November 16, 2026! 🕳️","summary":"The hole is almost ready.We’re excited to announce that Everybody Loves a Good Hole will officially launch on Steam on November 16, 2026!Get ready to steer your black hole, swallow hundreds of colorful cubes, grow bigger, earn XP and coins, unlock permanent upgrades, and unleash powerful magic-book abilities.What starts with a few tiny cubes quickly turns into colorful, screen-filling chaos.And then, of course…Just one more run.We’ve been working hard to make every run feel fast, satisfying, and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T09:15:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455101","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:54:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4978010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:06Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:05Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4978010":"2026-10-26T15:59:06Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4978010":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:05Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:05Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:05Z"},"5195860":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:06Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:06Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T15:59:06Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4978010","app